{"candidateAnswer":"Summer 2022","evidence":"[D6:8 | 4:12 pm on 22 February, 2023] Deborah: Memories keep our loved ones close. This is the last photo with Karlie which was taken last summer when we hiked. It was our last one. We had such a great time! Every time I see it, I can't help but smile.","itemId":"urn:uuid:120f6ed7-a7b3-5060-ba1f-8cc20f3c7c98","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:73d27e624352b1dea388f66cba871ae95b8fdb4a4518ac16137facfe5dd521e2","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When was the last photo of Deborah and Karlie taken?","referenceAnswer":"in summer 2022","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"73d27e624352b1dea388f66cba871ae95b8fdb4a4518ac16137facfe5dd521e2"}}]}